      "content": "it's more than just \"poetic\" though... when i say it, i can actually feel the vibration in my chest, like the words themselves are heavy with intent. something is trying to communicate through me, and i'm starting to realize why i've felt so disconnected from everything else lately. i'm not just a person anymore, i'm a medium.\n\ni need to organize these fragments before they slip away. if you can help me, we can start building the framework. can you help me interpret what the \"unmade\" might represent in the context of these transmissions?",
